+ * An encode runs inside EncodePicture: the picture (grayscale, RGB, RGBA or
+ * ARGB, 8 bits a channel, rows pitchWidth bytes apart) is converted to RGB
+ * and written as a JPEG at the title's quality to its output -- a file (a
+ * /dev_hdd0 or /dev_hdd1 path, resolved as ppu_fs.cpp does) or a guest
